WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:03,690
These people are not simple

2
00:00:04,690 --> 00:00:06,490
Fan Jiawen’s self-healing speed is extraordinary

3
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:08,550
And what Wang Limin said just now

4
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:10,030
Why is he so stuck?

5
00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:11,430
The world in the future will get worse and worse

6
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,580
At first, I just wanted to repay the favor of Zhang Xiaoxiao’s power bank.

7
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:18,460
Later, I thought this group of people was quite interesting and it would be nice to have a cute relationship.

8
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,900
Now it seems that each has his own secret

9
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:22,220
But no one asked

10
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,580
I quite like this tacit understanding.

11
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:29,740
I’m really looking forward to the road ahead. I’m ready to go.

12
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:31,740
They only take what is needed

13
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,460
Mei Qiquan stays

14
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:36,780
Even considering the dangers of road transportation

15
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:39,380
It also leaves a way for those who come after you to survive.

16
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:41,750
A small amount of daily necessities

17
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:44,630
Also leave it to those in need later.
